      <title>雪佛龙70亿美元投资委内瑞拉 将使当地石油产量翻倍</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/%E9%9B%AA%E4%BD%9B%E9%BE%9970%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E5%A7%94%E5%86%85%E7%91%9E%E6%8B%89-%E5%B0%86%E4%BD%BF%E5%BD%93%E5%9C%B0%E7%9F%B3%E6%B2%B9%E4%BA%A7%E9%87%8F%E7%BF%BB%E5%80%8D/</link>
